### VS Code ###
.vscode/

# Anchored to the backend root so these match scratch overrides here only.
# Unanchored, they also matched src/main/resources/application-{local,prod}.yml,
# which meant the real profile configs were never committed -- the prod image
# shipped without a prod profile and worked only via injected env vars.
/application-local.yml
/application-prod.yml
/application-*.local.yml
